_143":146,"_152":154},54,"Read the no-show reduction guide",[161],{"_143":146,"_152":159},53,"See salon pricing",[165],{"_143":146,"_152":163},52,"Browse all Silverstone AI services",[169],{"_143":146,"_152":167},51,"Late cancellations, no-shows, and manual chasing drain revenue fast. The ‘Chair-Filler Automation Suite’ shows where automation can quietly keep the diary fuller without changing how you work.",[174],"p.section-subtitle",{"_143":146,"_152":171},50,"level",2,"Ready to stop losing time and money to empty chairs?","h2.section-title","section","brand-gradient","animate",8,"section.section.bg-lines.animate",[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":221},[188,189,190,191,192,193,194],{"_143":132,"_125":220,"_176":177,"_146":221,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":216,"_146":217,"_148":218,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":212,"_146":213,"_148":214,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":208,"_146":209,"_148":210,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":204,"_146":205,"_148":206,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":200,"_146":201,"_148":202,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":195,"_146":196,"_148":197,"_127":198},49,"Whenever a client message falls outside the usual patterns, the system flags it for a human to handle. We design these handovers so that nothing important gets missed.",[199],"p",{"_143":146,"_152":196},48,"Yes. You can decide to treat high-value services or specific stylists differently. For example, colour appointments might have earlier reminders or firmer cancellation language than a quick trim.",[203],{"_143":146,"_152":201},47,"For a typical independent salon, the core flows can usually be live within a few weeks. We start with reminders and simple rebooking journeys, then expand once you are comfortable with how everything feels.",[207],{"_143":146,"_152":205},46,"No. The suite works with or without deposits. That said, we can help you introduce deposits or stricter cancellation rules if you decide they are appropriate for your clientele.",[211],{"_143":146,"_152":209},45,"In most cases, yes. We aim to connect to the system you already use so that bookings and changes stay in one place. If direct integration is not possible, we design simple handovers that still keep your diary accurate.",[215],{"_143":146,"_152":213},44,"Clients are generally grateful for clear reminders and easy ways to change appointments. We work with you to set sensible limits on how often messages go out and what they say. If you receive feedback that something feels too much, we adjust it.",[219],{"_143":146,"_152":217},43,"Salon Automation FAQs","bg-lines","parallax-section","compact-section",6,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":270},[229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238],{"_143":132,"_125":269,"_176":177,"_146":270,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":265,"_146":266,"_148":267,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":263,"_176":244,"_146":264,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":259,"_146":260,"_148":261,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":257,"_176":244,"_146":258,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":253,"_146":254,"_148":255,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":251,"_176":244,"_146":252,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":247,"_146":248,"_148":249,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":243,"_176":244,"_146":245,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":239,"_146":240,"_148":241,"_127":198},42,"You see a clear list of what is included and what it costs before anything goes live.",[242],{"_143":146,"_152":240},41,4,"Clear pricing upfront","h4",40,"We work with the booking tools you already use wherever possible.",[250],{"_143":146,"_152":248},39,"Works with your booking tools",38,"Messages are written in your salon’s tone of voice and can be adjusted at any time.",[256],{"_143":146,"_152":254},37,"Your salon’s tone of voice",36,"You choose how often clients hear from you and through which channels.",[262],{"_143":146,"_152":260},35,"You control frequency and channels",34,"Keep communication helpful — without spamming clients or changing your booking tool.",[268],{"_143":146,"_152":266},33,"On-brand, client-friendly, and in your control",5,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":314},[275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284],{"_143":132,"_125":313,"_176":177,"_146":314,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":309,"_146":310,"_148":311,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":307,"_176":244,"_146":308,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":303,"_146":304,"_148":305,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":301,"_176":244,"_146":302,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":297,"_146":298,"_148":299,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":295,"_176":244,"_146":296,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":291,"_146":292,"_148":293,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":289,"_176":244,"_146":290,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":285,"_146":286,"_148":287,"_127":198},32,"Expand to all clients, then tune messages and timings based on feedback and results.",[288],{"_143":146,"_152":286},31,"Roll out and refine",30,"Link the automations to your booking system and messaging channels, then test with a small group.",[294],{"_143":146,"_152":292},29,"Connect and test",28,"Decide when clients should receive messages, what they should say and how they should respond.",[300],{"_143":146,"_152":298},27,"Map your ideal journeys",26,"Review how you currently take bookings, send reminders and manage cancellations.",[306],{"_143":146,"_152":304},25,"Quick automation audit",24,"Get the core flows live, then refine with real feedback.",[312],{"_143":146,"_152":310},23,"Simple steps from audit to launch","section.section.bg-circuit.animate",[180,361,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":360},[319,320,321,322,323],{"_143":132,"_125":359,"_176":177,"_146":360,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":355,"_146":356,"_148":357,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":351,"_176":352,"_146":353,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":347,"_146":348,"_148":349,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":325,"_326":327,"_328":329,"_127":330},"list",22,"ordered",false,"items",[331,332,333,334],"ul",{"_146":344,"_148":345},{"_146":341,"_148":342},{"_146":338,"_148":339},{"_146":335,"_148":336},"Owners can step away from the desk without missing demand.",[337],{"_143":146,"_152":335},"Higher rebooking rates and steadier monthly revenue.",[340],{"_143":146,"_152":338},"Less manual chasing and rescheduling for owners and reception.",[343],{"_143":146,"_152":341},"Fewer no-shows and more of the day filled with paying clients.",[346],{"_143":146,"_152":344},21,"Consistent confirmations, reminders, and rebooking prompts keep more appointments happening on time.",[350],{"_143":146,"_152":348},20,3,"Less admin. Fuller days.","h3",19,"Fewer no-shows, more rebookings, and less chasing — without changing how you work on the floor.",[358],{"_143":146,"_152":356},18,"Fuller columns, calmer days","bg-circuit",[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":372},[365,366],{"_143":132,"_125":371,"_176":177,"_146":372,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":367,"_146":368,"_148":369,"_127":173},17,"One missed appointment is lost revenue, and hard to refill at short notice.",[370],{"_143":146,"_152":368},16,"Small no-show rates still hit revenue",[180,361,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":410},[376,377,378,379,380],{"_143":132,"_125":409,"_176":177,"_146":410,"_127":411},{"_143":144,"_125":405,"_146":406,"_148":407,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":403,"_176":352,"_146":404,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":399,"_146":400,"_148":401,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":381,"_326":327,"_328":382,"_127":330},15,[383,384,385,386],{"_146":396,"_148":397},{"_146":393,"_148":394},{"_146":390,"_148":391},{"_146":387,"_148":388},"Rebooking and lapsed-client nudges that bring people back.",[389],{"_143":146,"_152":387},"Quick answers for common questions on prices, hours, and locations.",[392],{"_143":146,"_152":390},"Cancellation flows that offer freed-up slots to waiting clients.",[395],{"_143":146,"_152":393},"Automated reminders with easy reschedule links.",[398],{"_143":146,"_152":396},14,"This bundle reduces no-shows, refills cancellations, and nudges repeat visits without adding front-desk load.",[402],{"_143":146,"_152":400},13,"Keep columns full quietly",12,"Reduce no-shows, refill cancellations, and nudge rebookings — without adding more admin.",[408],{"_143":146,"_152":406},11,"The ‘Chair-Filler Automation Suite’","h2#chair-filler-suite",1,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":447},[416,417,418,419,420],{"_143":132,"_125":225,"_176":177,"_146":447,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":443,"_146":444,"_148":445,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":183,"_176":352,"_146":442,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":126,"_146":439,"_148":440,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":421,"_326":327,"_328":422,"_127":330},10,[423,424,425,426],{"_146":436,"_148":437},{"_146":433,"_148":434},{"_146":430,"_148":431},{"_146":427,"_148":428},"Rebooking and upsell prompts happen inconsistently.",[429],{"_143":146,"_152":427},"Breaks and evenings disappear into reminders and reschedules.",[432],{"_143":146,"_152":430},"Calls ring while the team is busy with clients in the chair.",[435],{"_143":146,"_152":433},"No-shows and late cancellations leave paid time unused.",[438],{"_143":146,"_152":436},"When stylists are with clients, missed calls, late cancellations, and weak rebooking leave money in the chair.",[441],{"_143":146,"_152":439},"Where diary revenue leaks.",7,"No-shows, missed calls, and out-of-hours DMs quietly create gaps in the diary — even when demand is there.",[446],{"_143":146,"_152":444},"Empty chairs are expensive.",0,"section.hero.title-band",[478,479],{"_176":412,"_146":34},[453,454,455,456,457,458],{"_143":144,"_125":448,"_146":86,"_148":476,"_127":474},{"_143":144,"_125":412,"_146":84,"_148":473,"_127":474},{"_143":144,"_125":177,"_146":470,"_148":471,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":352,"_146":466,"_148":467,"_127":468},{"_143":144,"_125":244,"_146":463,"_148":464,"_127":150},{"_143":144,"_125":271,"_146":459,"_148":460,"_127":461},"See the ‘Chair-Filler Automation Suite’",[462],"a.btn.btn-secondary",{"_143":146,"_152":459},"Book a free salon automation audit",[465],{"_143":146,"_152":463},"Typical fit: chair-based businesses cutting no-shows, filling gaps, and rebooking before clients drift.",[469],"p.hero-context",{"_143":146,"_152":466},"Smart reminders, rebooking journeys, and a virtual receptionist keep your columns full when phones go unanswered.",[472],{"_143":146,"_152":470},[475],"a.hero-breadcrumb__link",{"_143":146,"_152":84},[477],{"_143":146,"_152":86},"hero","title-band",{"_125":448,"_176":412,"_146":34},{"_125":412,"_176":177,"_146":447},{"_125":177,"_176":352,"_146":442},{"_125":352,"_176":177,"_146":410},{"_125":244,"_176":352,"_146":404},{"_125":271,"_176":177,"_146":372},{"_125":225,"_176":177,"_146":360},{"_125":443,"_176":352,"_146":353},{"_125":183,"_176":177,"_146":314},{"_125":126,"_176":244,"_146":308},{"_125":421,"_176":244,"_146":302},{"_125":409,"_176":244,"_146":296},{"_125":405,"_176":244,"_146":290},{"_125":403,"_176":177,"_146":270},{"_125":399,"_176":244,"_146":264},{"_125":381,"_176":244,"_146":258},{"_125":371,"_176":244,"_146":252},{"_125":367,"_176":244,"_146":245},{"_125":359,"_176":177,"_146":221},{"_125":355,"_176":177,"_146":178},{"_125":448,"_502":535,"_504":536,"_506":537},{"_125":412,"_502":503,"_504":505,"_506":507},"types",[511,520,524],"rawJson","{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Will clients be annoyed by automated messages?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Clients are generally grateful for clear reminders and easy ways to change appointments. We work with you to set sensible limits on how often messages go out and what they say. If you receive feedback that something feels too much, we adjust it.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Does this work with our current booking system?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"In most cases, yes. We aim to connect to the system you already use so that bookings and changes stay in one place. If direct integration is not possible, we design simple handovers that still keep your diary accurate.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Do we have to take deposits for this to work?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"No. The suite works with or without deposits. That said, we can help you introduce deposits or stricter cancellation rules if you decide they are appropriate for your clientele.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How long does setup take?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"For a typical independent salon, the core flows can usually be live within a few weeks. We start with reminders and simple rebooking journeys, then expand once you are comfortable with how everything feels.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can we send different messages for different stylists or services?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes. You can decide to treat high-value services or specific stylists differently. For example, colour appointments might have earlier reminders or firmer cancellation language than a quick trim.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What if a client replies with a complex request?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Whenever a client message falls outside the usual patterns, the system flags it for a human to handle. We design these handovers so that nothing important gets missed.\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }","parsed",{"_508":509,"_510":511,"_512":513},"@context","https://schema.org","@type","FAQPage","mainEntity",[514,515,516,517,518,519],{"_